Robotiq 2F-140 visualization assets
===================================

This directory contains material copied or adapted from the
`robotiq_2f_gripper_description` package in:

  https://github.com/jannishaberhausen/robotiq_2f_gripper_ros2.git
  commit 17533fe6faa9688f40a7ccc1663f59054c6dc3e2

The twelve STL mesh files are byte-identical to that pinned package. The Xacro
files are copied, adapted, or derived versions used by `teleop_servo`, including
package-path changes and local joint-model behavior. They remain covered by the
ROS-Industrial BSD license reproduced in `LICENCE` in this directory. Local
modifications are identified in the Xacro file headers and do not replace the
upstream notice.
